WEBVTT

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:44.730
That pop quiz in
music class wasn't fair.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.420
But you did well, Chisato.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:49.300
I like music, but not classical.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.230
First off, where is Sorrento?
Is it in Russia?

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:55.530
Yukari?

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.810
What's the matter?

00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.740
Chisato...

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.510
Let me introduce you.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.580
This is Yuko Shigeri
from class B.

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:04.550
She's a friend of mine.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.650
Her brother might
be becoming neurotic.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.910
No! That's not it!

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.250
Everything started since that
mask came to our house.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.390
The mask... eh?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.630
Probably just a coincidence.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.490
Your brother is preparing for
the college exams, isn't he?

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.760
That's not it!
You'd know if you saw him!

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.360
He's been acting really strange!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:23.430
Yuko?

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:24.870
All right.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.760
I think you're overacting...

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.280
but since it's bothering you
so much I'll go see him.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.010
So, cheer up, ok?

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:32.110
Yeah.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.070
Why don't we all go!

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:36.540
Oh... Miyu, do you mind going?

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.140
No.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.750
I would like to see
that mask as well.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.360
Wow!

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:49.260
Your family must be rich, Yuko!

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:50.890
No, not anymore.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:54.190
Our family owned a big import-export
business a long time ago.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:59.400
That's why our house is like this and
my father is still a very proud man.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:05.410
I see.

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:09.440
If he sees this everyday, no wonder
your brother dreams about it.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.140
Spooky!

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.440
Isn't it, Miyu?

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:14.480
Yes, it is.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:17.310
Shinma...

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:21.590
but... unlike
any Shinma I know.

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:27.530
Miyu?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.030
What's wrong?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.330
Nothing... it was nothing.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.910
Oh, Kouichi, welcome home.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.110
Yeah.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.800
Good afternoon.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:39.570
Hi!

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:40.940
Hello!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:50.950
Make yourselves at home.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.250
My brother looks like he's
lost some more weight.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.130
You worry too much.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.800
If you keep worrying,
you'll get sick, Yuko.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.130
I'm home.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.270
Welcome home, darling.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.240
Yeah.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.540
Welcome home.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:10.970
Your friends?

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.150
- Hi.
- Good afternoon.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:12.870
Hello.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.010
They are interested in that mask.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.180
Oh... that's remarkable
for young women.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.810
It's... from Africa, right?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.450
You're well informed.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.350
A friend in Africa sent it to me.

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:29.060
But doesn't it make you feel icky?

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:34.460
You may not understand,
but it's very valuable.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.270
Does it have something
to do with Shamanism?

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.570
Has Yuko told you some story?

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:41.870
Even if it were used in a ritual...

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:45.070
that would have been
several hundred years ago.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:46.980
It's just superstition.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.610
But... since it came,
my brother has been!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.450
Kouichi is not so weak
as to be distracted by that!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:58.720
But my brother said he didn't
want to be a doctor and...

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.890
Did he say so?

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.090
What a troublemaker.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:06.230
Uh, excuse me, but why a doctor?

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:10.360
Because he obviously has the ability.
What else could he be?

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:18.070
Yuko and her brother must feel
suffocated with a father like that.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.840
He's hard to talk to.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.050
Hisae, what was it you were
asking him about?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.850
You mean Shamanism?

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:28.880
I was wondering if an ancient magician
might have used the mask.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.880
I saw something similar in a book.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.390
Then it's got a curse or something?

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:37.020
I don't know whether or not this kind
of thing can actually happen...

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:41.530
but the patterns on the mask might
have some kind of hypnotic effect.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:42.560
Really.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:44.830
What do you think, Miyu?

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:49.170
I think something is
wrong with the mask.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.980
You mean, you've seen
it before, Lava?

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:55.970
Yes.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.280
It was when I was
still a Western Shinma.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.850
Were you really?

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.750
When was that?

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.150
You don't remember, right, Lava?

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.690
Gee whiz, you treat me
like an outsider.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:11.890
At the time, I was on
a merchant ship...

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.660
pretending to be a European noble.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.300
I was performing reconnaissance...

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.430
to establish the power of the
Western Shinma on the New Continent.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.450
That's where he appeared.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.560
Everybody retreat!

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:55.140
He has some kind of magical power.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.810
You must know your
magic doesn't work on me.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.680
You are... Shinma?!

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.270
After that, the mask
appeared no more.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:44.020
However, all the
merchants died violently.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.090
I gave up the plan to
invade the continent...

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:52.120
because the mask's power was
something unfathomable to us.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.930
And the mask has
come after you, Lava?

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.530
Why now though?

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:00.170
Even I don't understand
what he has in mind.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.470
One possibility is...

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:05.770
There may be something
in Japan that attracts him.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.310
It could be, many Shinma
have been active recently.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.080
Shiina, do you feel something?

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:15.020
How can I?
I'm just a minor Shinma.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:16.890
Please, don't be so sullen.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:24.560
Looks like that mask
has caused some problems.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:44.880
Who do you think you are?

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.380
Hey, hey, wake up!

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.220
Do I look like a frail woman?

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.620
What's with the yelling?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.320
You think you're strong enough?

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.930
That's enough, boy!

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:11.230
It had to be the work of the mask.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.440
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:15.810
Then what else could it be?

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.650
My brother could have
killed somebody!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.690
Fortunately that man
forgave him this time.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.210
What are you gonna do about this?

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.260
Kouichi!

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:27.950
Kouichi!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:33.360
The mask... is the mask... safe?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.130
What are you talking about?

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:35.790
Kouichi!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.970
It's safe... my dear brother.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:42.700
Is it? That's good.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.810
You still insist nothing
is wrong with him?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.150
Please! Please help my brother!

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.320
Well, how can we help?

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.790
Hisae, do you have any ideas?

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:01.220
Your father seems to be
the real problem.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:02.430
I see...

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:06.260
He's the kind of person who
must see it to believe it.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:07.560
All right!

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:08.870
What are you gonna do?

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:10.030
You'll see if you come.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.600
Should I go?

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.340
I don't wanna force you to come.
'Cause things might get violent.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.070
What should I do?

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.840
I'll go and see.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:22.740
Eh?! But...

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.380
I don't believe it!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.180
I'm not saying that
I believe it, either.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:29.950
But if something happens...

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:33.220
Don't you think it's best
to get rid of the mask?

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.520
That's nonsense!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.660
Hey, aren't we affected by
the work of the mask?

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.660
I think we'll be fine.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.540
Kouichi.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.550
Brother!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:57.810
Kouichi!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.750
Stop acting stupid now!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.050
Wake up!

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:18.600
Miyu?

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:20.830
Miyu!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:21.970
Miyu!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.300
Where are you going?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:25.800
Miyu!!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.710
Miyu, what's wrong with you?

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:33.850
Miyu!!

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:40.580
This is my world.

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.000
I won't let you do
as you please here.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:45.160
Are you a Shinma?

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.730
What's your purpose in coming here?

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.330
Answer me.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:59.010
It's useless, Miyu.
He cannot communicate.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.840
Do you remember me?

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.620
You seem to remember.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:16.560
Our fight a hundred years ago,
now I'm going to finish it.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:37.880
Lava!

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.420
Shinma, to the Darkness with thee!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.090
Impossible!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.160
Miyu, his body isn't real.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.880
I see, Shiina.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:18.690
My flames can't break through!

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:19.950
Miyu...

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:22.490
Please stand aside.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.030
This is...

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.760
my fight.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:08.900
It is done.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.070
Lava... are you all right?

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.310
Thank you very much, Miyu.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:25.920
Miyu!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:26.890
Are you all right?

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.460
I broke it...

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:34.830
Miyu...

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:41.070
A mask like this had some power?

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:45.130
Perhaps he was in some
kind of hypnotic state.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:49.840
My dear brother...

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.750
Uh, the mask is finally gone...

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.790
Anyway, nothing will happen
to him anymore, I hope.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:14:59.020
Right.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.030
Say, Lava, what do you think?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.060
Was it his heart that
called the Shinma?

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:16.370
Even if it was, there's
nothing we can do about it.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:20.510
Right, it's not my job to
worry about the aftermath.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.570
Do your wounds hurt?

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:25.670
No.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:30.550
Lava, do you want to go back to the
world of the Western Shinma?

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:35.330
I fought against my past
and beat it, Miyu.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.330
That's right.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:43.570
Huh? They're off in their
own private world again.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:19.700
Give me back the forest!

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.660
What is it... Kouichi?

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:52.400
Father, it's about my future...

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.210
Give me back the forest!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:29.260
DVD Subtitling
NEW GENERATION PICTURES

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:39.310
Reiha, the vicious hunter,
has a cold mind.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:44.640
She doesn't care if humans
get involved with killing shinma.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.490
She may be right.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.790
But, I can't live like her.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.820
Because I am...

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.430
In the next episode of
Vampire Princess Miyu...

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.530
"REIHA HAS COME"

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:01.330
A long time ago,
I was a child, too.
